  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/CloendaPrimerTornEscoletaEstiuOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest divendres, 14 de juliol, s&#39;ha tancat al col&middot;legi Miralcamp el primer torn de l&#39;Escoleta d&#39;Estiu organitzada per l&#39;&agrave;rea de Serveis a la Ciutadania de l&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda. La segona part ser&agrave; fins dilluns 31 de juliol.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7315.jpg\" alt=\"img_7315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7316.jpg\" alt=\"img_7316\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7317.jpg\" alt=\"img_7317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7319.jpg\" alt=\"img_7319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7321.jpg\" alt=\"img_7321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7324.jpg\" alt=\"img_7324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7325.jpg\" alt=\"img_7325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7326.jpg\" alt=\"img_7326\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/clausutaescoletaestiucpmiralcamp/img_7327.j